canvas: 3 diagrams on one canvas, drawn whole at 100%
diagram d1 "worker and runtime: the two RPC seams" at 0,3: extent=75x6 nodes=2 edges=2 routes=2
  description: Task input plus control RPCs go down to modal-runtime; events plus management RPCs come back. Two directed seams, never one merged arrow.
diagram d2 "task dispatch down to the container" at 0,14: extent=133x5 nodes=4 edges=3 routes=3
  description: modal-runtime dispatches tasks to the Task engine, which starts and manages a Container backend that runs the user process in the Task container.
diagram d3 "storage and daemon interfaces" at 0,24: extent=107x10 nodes=5 edges=3 routes=3
  description: The engine mounts and snapshots Filesystem + volumes, whose data flows to Blobnet; modal-runtime reaches modal-daemon over filesystem HTTP on UDS, not worker gRPC.
